---
title: Request path
---
flowchart LR
    client([Browser]) --> cdn>CDN edge]
    cdn --> api-gw[[API gateway]]
    subgraph backend [Backend services]
        direction TB
        api-gw --> users(Users) & orders(Orders)
        subgraph data["Data"]
            pg[(Postgres)]
            cache((Redis))
        end
        users --> pg
        orders -- writes --> pg
        orders -.->|warms| cache
    end
    orders ==> queue{{Queue}}
    queue --o worker[/Worker/]
    worker --x dlq[\Dead letters\]
    client ~~~ worker
    worker:::hot --> client
    classDef hot fill:#fde68a
    style queue fill:#e0e7ff
